WEBVTT

00:16.640 --> 00:17.680
Empress, don't worry

00:17.760 --> 00:19.160
And harm your health

00:20.640 --> 00:21.480
Your Highness

00:21.560 --> 00:22.400
With Prince of Ning

00:22.520 --> 00:23.560
With His Majesty

00:23.640 --> 00:24.520
And the Empress

00:24.640 --> 00:26.000
Are one family

00:26.080 --> 00:26.760
One family

00:26.840 --> 00:28.440
What life-and-death enmity is there?

00:29.240 --> 00:30.040
Some people

00:30.120 --> 00:32.000
No matter how much they sow discord

00:32.080 --> 00:34.360
As long as His Majesty is willing to see Your Highness

00:34.440 --> 00:35.840
Everything will become clear

00:38.200 --> 00:39.600
Endure a bit longer

00:40.120 --> 00:41.520
This game

00:42.040 --> 00:43.707
Should reach the decisive move

00:44.500 --> 00:48.500
Some time later, your injuries had largely healed, and the Emperor summoned you to an audience in the Yuzheng Palace.

00:50.920 --> 00:52.320
You

00:52.480 --> 00:53.640
Think yourself

00:53.720 --> 00:55.120
Are wronged

00:56.160 --> 00:57.240
What your son says

00:57.320 --> 00:58.720
Comes from the heart

00:59.040 --> 01:00.600
Everything was to investigate the embezzlement

01:00.680 --> 01:02.040
Of relief funds

01:02.120 --> 01:03.200
Your son

01:03.280 --> 01:04.680
Has a clear conscience

01:04.840 --> 01:07.120
What a clear conscience

01:08.120 --> 01:09.240
I ask you

01:09.320 --> 01:11.320
Since what you seek is righteous

01:11.600 --> 01:13.640
Why privately deploy troops?

01:14.280 --> 01:15.680
Why not report it?

01:16.000 --> 01:17.667
Why not find your father?

01:18.000 --> 01:19.080
Or do you think

01:19.160 --> 01:21.080
Your father is also involved?

01:21.480 --> 01:22.520
Do you think your father

01:22.600 --> 01:24.000
Also took their money?

